Now that the lessons review has expired, I'll renege :-) . I agree with 
the suggestions made to me that the level 0 book should take priority, 
and be used ASAP to test out the Print On Demand service. Therefore, 
while I will work on the lessons this coming week, I am now calling on 
Lojbanists to review the Level 0 book (found same place you found the 
lessons), with a deadline of Monday September 30. (Not an ironclad 
deadline, but I strongly suspect there's less to be done with the Level 
0 book.) Suggestions on the appropriate wiki page: 
http://nuzban.wiw.org/wiki/index.php?Level%200%20Booklet

(And thanks to those who have already contributed. If you don't already 
appear in the acknowledgements and wish to, please sign your names 
there.)

